{"id":"071284ecec3316e1e64af3e25d3ca8b2","choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'll analyze the current shot B01-S01 and generate the compact local performance contract.\n\nThe shot B01-S01 covers two action steps from the raw linear script:\n- Step 0: 方澄 standing at her desk with bag on chair back, ticket at desk corner\n- Step 1: 林屿 sitting at his desk, pushing customer detail sheet toward middle\n\nNo dialogue in this shot. Both steps are kind=action.\n\nLet me trace through the actions carefully and build the operations.\n\n**Step 0**: 方澄 (C01) stands at her desk (E01), bag (P01) on chair back (E09), movie ticket (P02) at desk corner. The start_state already shows her standing with bag on E09 and ticket on E01.\n\n**Step 1**: 林屿 (C02) sits at his desk (E02), pushes the customer detail sheet (P05) toward the middle. The start state shows P05 on E02 surface.\n\nThe detail sheet needs to be moved/slid from its location toward the middle. Using slide operation: P05 from surface:E02 to surface:E02 (different area toward middle).\n\nLet me structure the groups:\n\nGroup 1 (step 0): Establish C01's standing position, bag on chair, ticket on desk. Start state already has these. So C01 maintains standing, bag and ticket already in place. Operations mostly empty (hold), maybe gaze to ticket.\n\nActually looking again at start_state, everything is already in initial position. So step 0 is establishing/confirming the opening visual state.\n\nGroup 2 (step 1): C02 sits at desk, slides P05 toward middle. C02 is already sitting per start_state. P05 slides on E02 toward the middle/between area.\n\nLet me construct the JSON now. Since C02 is already sitting per start_state, no sit operation needed. The main action is sliding P05.\n\nWait - I need to re-read. Start state for C02 says \"sitting\" already. So the action for step 1 is mainly pushing the detail sheet. Let me check if \"push\" maps to slide. Yes, slide is the right operation.\n\nFor C02 in group 2: slide P05 on E02 toward the middle area between the two desks.\n\nFor C01: she maintains her standing position, gaze at ticket.\n\nLet me also add a group for the establishing hold of the scene.\n\nLet me finalize:\n\nGroup 1 (step 0): subject C01, establishing shot - she stands at desk, bag on chair, ticket visible\n- operations: empty (hold established state), performance describing the standing pose and visible objects\n\nGroup 2 (step 1): subject C02, sliding the customer sheet\n- C02 slides P05 from one area of E02 to a middle area of E02\n- Performance describing the push\n\nNo satisfies entries for this opening establishing beat (B01 has no performance_requirements).\n\nLet me write the final JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dialogue_performance\": \"\",\n  \"actions\": [\n    {\n      \"source_step_ref\": \"raw_linear_script.beats.0.steps.0\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"seconds\": 2.5,\n          \"subject\": \"C01\",\n          \"performance\": \"方澄穿着灰蓝色薄针织开衫站在浅木色工位前，米灰色挎包已挂在椅背上，米白底深红字的院线电影票压在桌角伸手可及处。侧脸半侧对桌面，五官在夕光侧光下克制、未表态。\",\n          \"operations\": [],\n          \"satisfies\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_step_ref\": \"raw_linear_script.beats.0.steps.1\",\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"seconds\": 3.5,\n          \"subject\": \"C02\",\n          \"performance\": \"林屿穿着米驼色棉质衬衫坐在方澄右边的工位，没抬头看她。右手按住A4横版客户明细单往两人桌面之间推了推，黑色签字笔和A4纵版结算单仍摊在桌角手边，白色陶瓷咖啡杯留在原位。红笔批注在明细单上可读。\",\n          \"operations\": [\n            [\"slide\", \"C02\", \"P05\", \"surface:E02:两人之间\"]\n          ],\n          \"satisfies\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nWait, slide requires the actor to hold the item. P05 holder is \"none\". Let me check the rule again: \"holder=none才可take/slide\". So holder=none CAN take/slide. That's fine.\n\nBut actually slide means moving along a surface. The actor pushes the sheet. The holder remains none since it's just being pushed, not picked up. That should be OK.\n\nLet me refine the seconds and content. This is the opening establishing shot, roughly 6 seconds total for both steps. Let me adjust:\n\nGroup 1 = 3 seconds (establishing C01's state)\nGroup 2 = 3 seconds (C02 pushing the sheet)\n\nThe dialogue_performance should be empty since no dialogue in this beat. Wait, looking at dialogue_mode for B01-S01: \"无对白\". So dialogue_performance = \"\".\n\nLet me also reconsider - the description for step 0 says \"方澄穿着灰蓝色薄针织开衫站在自己浅木色工位前\" - so she's standing. And \"米灰色挎包已经挂上椅背\" - bag on chair back. \"米白底深红字的院线电影票压在桌角\" - ticket at desk corner. These are all visible in the start state.\n\nFor step 1: 林屿 sits, \"把自己桌上那份A4横版客户明细单往两人之间的方向推了推\" - pushes the customer detail sheet toward the middle.\n\nThe slide operation makes sense. C02 slides P05 on E02 surface toward the middle area.\n\nI think the JSON is ready. Let me finalize and submit.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_01a10af8b12a7775ac1aaa6d","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_creative_json","arguments":"{\"payload_json\":\"{\\\"dialogue_performance\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"actions\\\":[{\\\"source_step_ref\\\":\\\"raw_linear_script.beats.0.steps.0\\\",\\\"groups\\\":[{\\\"seconds\\\":3,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C01\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"方澄穿着灰蓝色薄针织开衫站在浅木色工位前，侧身半侧对桌面，米灰色挎包已挂在椅背上金属扣可读，米白底深红字的院线电影票压在桌角自己伸手就能拿到的位置。临窗夕光从侧面斜入，克制尚未表态。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[],\\\"satisfies\\\":[]}]},{\\\"source_step_ref\\\":\\\"raw_linear_script.beats.0.steps.1\\\",\\\"groups\\\":[{\\\"seconds\\\":3,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿穿着米驼色棉质衬衫坐在方澄右边工位的黑色网面转椅上，没抬头看她，视线落在自己桌面。右手按住A4横版客户明细单往两人桌面之间推了推，红笔批注在浅灰线条格上可读；A4纵版结算单仍摊在桌角、黑色签字笔在桌沿、白色陶瓷咖啡杯留在原位。\\\",\\\"operations\\\":[[\\\"slide\\\",\\\"C02\\\",\\\"P05\\\",\\\"surface:E02:两人之间\\\"]],\\\"satisfies\\\":[]}]}]}\"}"}}]}}],"created":1791185389,"model":"MiniMax-M3","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"total_tokens":18744,"total_characters":0,"prompt_tokens":17196,"completion_tokens":1548,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128}}